local ADMIN=123456
local cd={}
local function invis(c,on)
 local h=c:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid");if h then h.DisplayDistanceType=on and 0 or 1 end
 for _,d in ipairs(c:GetDescendants()) do
  if d:IsA("BasePart") or d:IsA("Decal") then d.Transparency=on and 1 or 0 end
 end
end
game.Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(p)
 p:SetAttribute("Inv",false);p:SetAttribute("Inf",false)
 p.Chatted:Connect(function(m)
  if p.UserId~=ADMIN then return end
  local a,b=m:match("^/(%w+)%s+(%w+)$");b=(b=="on")
  if a=="inv" then p:SetAttribute("Inv",b); if p.Character then invis(p.Character,b) end end
  if a=="inf" then p:SetAttribute("Inf",b) end
 end)
 p.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(c) invis(c,p:GetAttribute("Inv")==true) end)
end)
function CanCast(p,skill,sec)
 if p:GetAttribute("Inf") then return true end
 cd[p]=cd[p] or {}; local t=os.clock()
 if t-(cd[p][skill] or 0)<sec then return false end
 cd[p][skill]=t; return true
end
function SkillDamage(targetHum,dmg)
 local pl=game.Players:GetPlayerFromCharacter(targetHum.Parent)
 if pl and pl:GetAttribute("Inv") then return end
 targetHum:TakeDamage(dmg)
end
